    p(x_1, \cdots, x_n) = c_{n, m} e^{2\sum_{1\le i<j\le n} \log |x_j-x_i|- \sum_{i=1}^n V(x_i) }, 
    \quad V(x)= x-(m-n)\log x,$$ where $c_{m,n}$ is the normalization constant. Let $x_{\max}=\max\{x_1, \cdots, x_n\}$.

